114	/* The prompt-box glow ring (PromptHero) — a Gemini-style "chasing light"
115	   ring. CRITICAL: the ring's own box never rotates. Earlier versions
116	   animated `transform: rotate()` on the ring element itself, which — since
117	   the composer is a wide rectangle, not a square — swings the corners way
