COLOUR reaches the model two ways that cannot drift, both derived from one BrandPalette: a Tailwind v4 @theme block spliced into src/index.css between markers (so the builder own CSS survives, verified idempotent and byte-exact on removal), and a prompt fragment naming the catalogue preset id AND every exact hex plus a computed contrast line. An adjective palette is a 400.

