   success/failed/other split a visual reference showed.
   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   THAT SPLIT CANNOT BE HONEST HERE: a failed build is charged zero credits
   (see notCharged in ./data.ts) — chargeForBuild is only ever reached on the
